<title>TURKEY: Turkey's 1996 copper output rises, alumina falls.</title>
<headline>Turkey's 1996 copper output rises, alumina falls.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's blister copper production rose to 30,341 tonnes in 1996 from 24,416 tonnes in 1995, the State Institute of Statistics said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the country's alumina output fell to 159,298 tonnes from 171,978 a year earlier.</p>
<p>--Ankara Newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
</text>
